[00:09.26]Come alive tonight
[00:09.26]今夜 焕发生机
[00:10.26]Spent the whole day in my head, just stressed out
[00:10.26]整日思绪翻涌 满心焦灼
[00:12.78]Are we alright?
[00:12.78]我们还能重归于好吗？
[00:13.78]I know I say the wrong things sometimes, I'm a letdown
[00:13.78]我知道有时我言辞失当 让你失望
[00:15.29]
[00:15.80]But we gave some time
[00:15.80]但我们已然熬过一段时光
[00:17.36]And I fly too close to the sun with you now
[00:17.36]如今 我与你一同 向太阳奋力翱翔
[00:19.87]But let's dry our eyes
[00:19.87]就让我们擦干泪水
[00:21.89]And put it on the line
[00:21.89]孤注一掷 赌上所有
[00:22.89]
[00:23.39]Signing off then, no replies, yeah
[00:23.39]就此别过 不再回复 是啊
[00:25.40]I don't know where this was hiding
[00:25.40]我不知道这份情愫曾藏匿何处
[00:26.90]You got impeccable timing
[00:26.90]你总能恰逢其时 降临身旁
[00:28.94]Drifting away, I was sliding
[00:28.94]我曾一度漂泊 濒临坠落
[00:31.04]I'm in your light and it's blinding
[00:31.04]而你的光芒 耀眼夺目 让我无法直视
[00:32.04]
[00:36.07]Put your body into mine tonight
[00:36.07]今夜 让你的身躯与我相融
[00:39.71]Got the weight of your love on my mind
[00:39.71]你沉甸甸的爱意 萦绕我心头
[00:44.86]In the darkness, you just burn so bright
[00:44.86]黑暗之中 你依旧光芒万丈
[00:49.50]I can see you from a thousand miles
[00:49.50]千里之外 我亦能望见你的身影
[00:50.00]
[00:54.59]And if you need to know, then ask me why
[00:54.59]若你想知晓缘由 便尽管问我
[00:59.60]Orbit me, my satellite
[00:59.60]环绕我吧 我的卫星
